THcGOmczdETGoJVOlFRvdgrdo5Wu2W-WIMBSihVGiOfr_yV8v0zqnCKjX7GXYypwVqvE3A7fzOryzZlp_RaK1J5rc4lrEXnzG7eqBILFvHw7pQeEYl0FH5me8wL8qMAFNQfPcXwOXXu1Yt9tIgCbaIfNN4EJhZgv3peZZMcPs2XWiBjXdVGvOFDeG1lDIUMuNNLD_SlnPMOBd-3sACS9iy6fKlzE47WfVB2thi0Vm5r_yvdnCNgPdZ-MVvBbDbFvTkgPbq7FgQuz38EyQbyHrHYBgqJfxGqcZDa9ixfsvbd6bkhDRBgDQEFTyMarAux3U8FKv39naZEtmGWctK8RLzI4wqV_pYL3MPb7O-GR14XHEVoUgtIxlegx58IT5yRFLlZDnEEtfAQGyb5vtcUM6KF6olAa6QVxZCkcCIDzsAXwhmBbA-kIRsaH0iGOGncCpL6ET1cwn4HMxFuUlh2j8dhB_tckiTA-w4VdJod6VaAY5Uci22xhLuP7Jh1aMuc2TtKBpOYYUBnwmNjlKOg9Zd4oE35-QpeV1WWhL3GuoPUTHQSep1WjjtHSZs-sfdqZUxKORjcni1KPpJNxP1lYQ1bxoxQ4auB5epfgfgWMyFI1BRHCypGoAvmiOJJ9XybEebzsWIk7oq-p-IwKqx5cGoBqQ11bOZdtFkjRq_zf7j0cDWNMi_-cqv2snNqaA-7ordjekhuQZSgsXNoom3XG_iqIQwNpLs7zmGBzTclPgV0QVvmD1QXQiB_nvsiMZzEdk6zFRuiNZ9gaNSp4z4JAm0dLriFIZN80UKW5DelbaFgbOT7IVABNyEqS7PEbAnwm--qGGV2117r1JWmIGFrGuP-gXvw"},{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_0841f4c0202f7d6f016ae2160b1fd08191931156516d2e4194","call_id":"call_037ff6b1daed4cc0a27ad1de5a883a94","name":"check_lean_types","arguments":"{\"header\":\"import Mathlib\\n\\nnoncomputable section\\nnamespace LR\\n\\ndef localRing (p : ℕ) : Subring ℚ := Subring.closure {q | ∃ a d : ℤ, ¬ (p : ℤ) ∣ d ∧ q = (a : ℚ) / d}\\nabbrev R (p : ℕ) := ↥(localRing p)\\nnoncomputable instance rRat (p : ℕ) : Algebra (R p) ℚ := (localRing p).subtype.toAlgebra\\nnoncomputable instance rComplex (p : ℕ) : Algebra (R p) ℂ := ((algebraMap ℚ ℂ).comp (localRing p).subtype).toAlgebra\\nvariable {V : Type} [AddCommGroup V] [Module ℂ V]\\nnoncomputable instance rModule (p : ℕ) : Module (R p) V := Module.compHom V (algebraMap (R p) ℂ)\\nnoncomputable instance rTower (p : ℕ) : IsScalarTower (R p) ℂ V := IsScalarTower.of_compHom (R p) ℂ V\\n\\ndef vec (y : Module.End ℂ V) (v : V) (i : ℕ) : V := ((i.factorial : ℂ)⁻¹) • (y ^ i) v\\ndef divided (x : Module.End ℂ V) (r : ℕ) : Module.End ℂ V := ((r.factorial : ℂ)⁻¹) • x ^ r\\ndef MR (p : ℕ) (M : Submodule ℤ V) : Submodule (R p) V := Submodule.span (R p) (M : Set V)\\ndef J (p λ : ℕ) (M : Submodule ℤ V) (y : Module.End ℂ V) (v : V) (i : ℕ) : Submodule (R p) ℂ := (MR p M).comap ((LinearMap.toSpanSingleton ℂ V (vec y v i)).restrictScalars (R p))\\ndef unit (λ : ℕ) (b : Module.Basis (Fin (λ+1)) ℂ V) (i j : Fin (λ+1)) : Module.End ℂ V := (b.coord j).smulRight (b i)\\nabbrev VK (K : Type) [Field K] (M : Submodule ℤ V) := TensorProduct ℤ K M\\nstructure Lift (M : Submodule ℤ V) (f : Module.End ℂ V) where\\n  map : Module.End ℤ M\\n  agrees : ∀ m : M, (map m : V) = f m\\nstructure Actions (M : Submodule ℤ V) (x y h : Module.End ℂ V) where\\n  x : Lift M x\\n  y : Lift M y\\n  h : Lift M h\\n  X : ∀ r : ℕ, Lift M (divided x r)\\n  Y : ∀ r : ℕ, Lift M (divided y r)\\ndef induced (K : Type) [Field K] (M : Submodule ℤ V) (f : Module.End ℤ M) : Module.End K (VK K M) := f.baseChange K\\ndef pMR (p : ℕ) (M : Submodule ℤ V) : Submodule (R p) (MR p M) := LinearMap.range ((p : R p) • (LinearMap.id : Module.End (R p) (MR p M)))\\nabbrev QMR (p : ℕ) (M : Submodule ℤ V) := (MR p M) ⧸ pMR p M\\nend LR\\n\",\"parameters\":[{\"name\":\"p\",\"type\":\"ℕ\"},{\"name\":\"K\",\"type\":\"Type\"},{\"name\":\"fieldK\",\"type\":\"Field K\",\"binder_kind\":\"instance\"},{\"name\":\"V\",\"type\":\"Type\"},{\"name\":\"addV\",\"type\":\"AddCommGroup V\",\"binder_kind\":\"instance\"},{\"name\":\"modV\",\"type\":\"Module ℂ V\",\"binder_kind\":\"instance\"},{\"name\":\"M\",\"type\":\"Submodule ℤ V\"}],\"types\":[\"LR.R p\",\"LR.MR p M\",\"Module.Basis (Fin 3) (LR.R p) (LR.MR p M)\",\"∀ ρ : LR.R p →+* K, letI := ρ.toAlgebra; Nonempty (LR.VK K M ≃ₗ[K] TensorProduct (LR.R p) K (LR.MR p M))\",\"∀ σ : LR.R p →+* ZMod p, ∃ s : Module (ZMod p) (LR.QMR p M), letI := s; ∀ r : LR.R p, ∀ z : LR.QMR p M, r • z = σ r • z\"]}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"search_external_sources","description":"Follow source-retrieval.md: arxiv first (default; an exact arXiv ID is allowed), then google title/author search, then google title/author DOI search, then scihub with a confirmed DOI. Use browser:true for normal local-browser readback of JavaScript/verification pages. Results and DOI strings are locators, not source/theorem approval. Record failed access and continue conditionally when the original stays unavailable.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"},"engine":{"type":"string","enum":["arxiv","google","scihub"]},"browser":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_external_source","description":"Read and retain a public HTTPS source and its hash-bound access record. Use offset to continue cached text. Retry with browser:true for a normal isolated local Chrome session if HTTPS needs JavaScript or verification. The optional browser uses ordinary site controls; unsupported challenges remain explicit failures. Verify full PDF identity, version, theorem and context yourself.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"url":{"type":"string"},"offset":{"type":"integer"},"limit":{"type":"integer"},"browser":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["url"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read one declared frozen document. For JSON use pointer (empty string lists the root); large objects return keys, and strings resume with offset=next_offset. For text use inclusive start/end lines and column=next_column when continuing a long line. Every serialized result is at most 32 KiB. Follow has_more and the returned continuation coordinates; no arbitrary local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"},"column":{"type":"integer"},"pointer":{"type":"string"},"offset":{"type":"integer"},"limit":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"},"column":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","description":"Check a JSON artifact against the explicit stage contract; this is not automatic mathematical certification.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_artifact","description":"Submit a JSON artifact after its stage checks.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"report_obstacle","description":"Report an actual obstacle using these five direct fields. Countercheck the alleged implication against the complete definitions, quantifiers and inequality directions; a feasible example alone does not determine an extremum. A fact not yet proved or registered in the current draft is an obligation to complete, not by itself a gap. For a mathematical stop, identify the concrete implication and actual mathematical difficulty encountered during normal checking/completion, not merely unfilled inventory or exposition. No fixed time/attempt count or counterexample is required. SUBSTANTIVE_GAP/SUSPECTED_GAP stop for an actual supported mathematical obstruction; INPUT_CONFLICT stops for incompatible inputs. In NL0, use source retrieval and explicit conditional deferral for unavailable primary texts; MISSING_SOURCE_STATEMENT requires that no complete secondary statement can be obtained. Other stages may report SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE for an actual access obstacle. Ordinary unfinished work is not an obstacle report. No mathematical acceptance is generated.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"status":{"type":"string","enum":["SUBSTANTIVE_GAP","SUSPECTED_GAP","SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE","MISSING_SOURCE_STATEMENT","INPUT_CONFLICT"]},"location":{"type":"string"},"explanation":{"type":"string"},"basis":{"type":"string"},"partial_progress":{"type":"string"}},"required":["status","location","explanation","basis","partial_progress"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_draft","description":"Preferred structured-object form of check_artifact: provide artifact as an actual JSON object, not an escaped JSON string. Same complete validation and acceptance scope.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}},"required":["artifact"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_draft","description":"Preferred structured-object form of submit_artifact: provide artifact as an actual JSON object, not an escaped JSON string. Same complete validation and acceptance scope.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}},"required":["artifact"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":nul